<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8912] PartitionLossPolicy.READ_ONLY_SAFE does not detect partition loss </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8912</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Cluster of 4 for a cache with 1 backup and READ_ONLY_SAFE .&lt;br/&gt;
After forcefully killed two nodes, a partition lost without including in partitionsLost collection. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
